Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.67,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:唐·特里的《膝盖颤抖》]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Knees Shakin' by Don Terry]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:09.99,c,,0,0,0,,♪我望着高山，高山开始摇晃♪\N{\rEng}♪ And I looked at a mountain and the mountain started shakin'♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.78,c,,0,0,0,,♪我望着巨岩，巨岩开始碎裂♪\N{\rEng}♪ I looked at a boulder and the boulder started breakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.65,c,,0,0,0,,♪我望着地面，地面开始摇晃♪\N{\rEng}♪ I looked at the ground and the ground started shakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:18.17,c,,0,0,0,,♪我望着你，我的膝盖开始颤抖♪\N{\rEng}♪ When I looked at you my knees started shakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rc\fs25\shad2\1c&HFFFFFF&\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}《地狱男爵：歪曲人》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\rc\fs25\shad2\1c&HFFFFFF&\4a&H50&\3c&HFF8000&\4c&HFF8000&}（1959年）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔，你听到了吗？\N{\rEng}Joe, you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:57.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,没有，听到什么？\N{\rEng}No Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为大红不怕任何东西\N{\rEng}I thought Big Red wasn't scared of anything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是毛骨悚然了，朋友？\N{\rEng}You getting the heebie-jeebies, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是毛骨悚然本身\N{\rEng}I am the heebie-jeebies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:15.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我一下，为什么初级特工要跟着来？\N{\rEng}Remind me why Junior G-man's coming along for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:17.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来确保箱子里的东西\N{\rEng}I'm just here to make sure that whatever's in that box
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:19.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,和一位美女\N{\rEng}and one pretty lady
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.65,0:01:22.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,能安全地再走600英里到费尔菲尔德\N{\rEng}make another 600 miles to,Fairfield without any trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:36.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那么箱子里是什么？\N{\rEng}So what's in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我该告诉他吗？\N{\rEng}Should I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.07,0:01:43.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一只漏斗网蜘蛛\N{\rEng}A funnel-web spider
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是世界上最致命的蛛形纲动物\N{\rEng}Probably the most deadly arachnid in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:50.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过这只似乎寄宿着\N{\rEng}Only this one seems to house a plausibly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个疑似恶魔的实体\N{\rEng}demonic entity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在开玩笑吧，对吧？\N{\rEng}You're yanking my chain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这还不是全部\N{\rEng}That's not the half of it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:59.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,与这个生物相关的还有各种奇怪的现象\N{\rEng}There's all manner of bizarre phenomena associated with this creature
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,时间的、引力的\N{\rEng}Temporal, gravitational
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:02.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你难以置信的事情\N{\rEng}I mean things you wouldn't believe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:04.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我几乎不敢相信，而我已经详细\N{\rEng}I barely believe it and I've cataloged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,记录了照片证据\N{\rEng}the photographic evidence in detail
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:07.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它一直被保持镇静\N{\rEng}It's been kept sedated
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,处于感官剥夺状态\N{\rEng}in a state of sensory deprivation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:12.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们能在更受控的环境中分析它\N{\rEng}until we can analyze it in a more controlled setting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:14.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,该死，你真的没听到吗？\N{\rEng}Dammit, you're not hearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:16.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱男爵，你没事吧？\N{\rEng}Hellboy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.41,0:02:19.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么了？\N{\rEng}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:22.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊！\N{\rEng}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:23.93,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:唐·特里的《膝盖颤抖》继续]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Knees Shakin'' by Don Terry continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊！\N{\rEng}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:31.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:33.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 心在痛 骨头在碎 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Heart achin' bones a Breakin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我爱上了你\N{\rEng}♪ I'm in love with you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:38.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:30.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧？ - 是的，没事\N{\rEng}- You alright? - Yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.39,0:03:32.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，装死一会儿\N{\rEng}Hey, lay dead a sec
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!操!\N{\rEng}Ah! Oh fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:46.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我去\N{\rEng}Oh shit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱男爵,地狱男爵,看\N{\rEng}Hellboy, Hellboy, look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢它们小一点的\N{\rEng}I like them better small
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:25.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,别让它逃跑,别让它逃跑\N{\rEng}Don't let him get away,Don't let him get away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:35.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\rEng}It's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦糟了\N{\rEng}Oh crap
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:52.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会在树林中间建一条通往地狱的隧道?\N{\rEng}Who builds a tunnel to hell in the middle of the woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:55.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,某种通风井\N{\rEng}Some kind of ventilation shaft
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,煤矿区\N{\rEng}Coal mining country
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:01.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,阿巴拉契亚\N{\rEng}Appalachia
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:06.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧太棒了,我们丢了货\N{\rEng}Well that's just swell, we lost the cargo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你先请\N{\rEng}After you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\rEng}Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.07,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,嘿,嘿\N{\rEng}He, he, he
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔?\N{\rEng}Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\rEng}I'm okay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,实地工作,嗯?\N{\rEng}Field work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,跟研究工作不太一样,是吧?\N{\rEng}It's not much like research, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:47.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不明白\N{\rEng}I just don't get it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:50.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,蜘蛛是什么让它变得如此疯狂?\N{\rEng}Spider what made it go crazy like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这些山里有些东西\N{\rEng}Something in these hills
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,树木,\N{\rEng}Trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:00.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有泥土\N{\rEng}and the dirt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:03.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,某种闹鬼的东西\N{\rEng}Something haunted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的\N{\rEng}Evil
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方有一股臭味\N{\rEng}This place has the stink
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:13.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到松针的味道?\N{\rEng}I smell pine needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之下,乔\N{\rEng}Underneath that, Joe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是疯狂\N{\rEng}Madness
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:20.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡,\N{\rEng}Death,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呼唤着蜘蛛爸爸\N{\rEng}called out to Daddy Longlegs
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,唤醒了它\N{\rEng}Woke him up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:26.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的?\N{\rEng}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗的东西会呼唤黑暗的东西\N{\rEng}Dark things call to dark things
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:34.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我也听到了\N{\rEng}I heard it too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真是完蛋了\N{\rEng}We are so screwed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,完蛋、玩完、一败涂地\N{\rEng}Screwed, chewed, and tattooed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:44.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要,我们需要找个电话 我们得报告这事\N{\rEng}We need, we need to find a phone We need to call this in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,妈?\N{\rEng}Ma?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:10.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在这附近我不确定我们俩谁更引人注目\N{\rEng}Around these parts I'm not sure which one of us stands out more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:13.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是魔鬼沿路上来了\N{\rEng}It's the devil come up the road
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\rEng}No it ain't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:17.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,走开!\N{\rEng}Get!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是联合国那个红色家伙\N{\rEng}It's that red fella from the United Nations
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.84,0:07:23.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾在《生活》杂志封面上见过他一次\N{\rEng}I've seen him once on the cover of Life magazine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:25.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,联合国?\N{\rEng}United Nations?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你\N{\rEng}Look at you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,小东方娃娃\N{\rEng}little oriental doll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:33.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你可真是个漂亮的小东西\N{\rEng}Ain't you a purdy thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:35.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\rEng}Um
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我是宋特工,女士\N{\rEng}I'm Special Agent Song, ma'am
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:40.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出了车祸，请问你们有电话吗？\N{\rEng}We've been in an accident; do you happen to have a phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:41.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有\N{\rEng}Sure we do
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就在后面，彩电旁边\N{\rEng}It's in back next to the color television
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:50.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有那只会拉银元的鸡旁边\N{\rEng}and the chicken that shits out silver dollars
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:55.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有奔驰车旁边 - 好吧\N{\rEng}- and the Mercedes Benz - Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不如进来吧\N{\rEng}May as well come inside
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:02.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,夫人，给他们些现代衣服穿，亲爱的，他们的衣服都破了，还沾满了血\N{\rEng}Ma'am, get these on some modern rags, doll, they're all cut up and bloody
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦不，不用麻烦了\N{\rEng}Oh no, that's not necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了？\N{\rEng}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我发现他，他就一动不动\N{\rEng}He ain't moved a muscle since I found him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:18.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,有人想过带他去看医生吗？\N{\rEng}Anyone thought of taking him to the doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这儿有医生吧？\N{\rEng}You guys have doctors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:23.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还是你们喜欢他当地毯？ - 卡车坏了\N{\rEng}- Or you like him as a rug? - Truck's out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:25.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,再说了，医生也帮不了他\N{\rEng}Anyhow ain't no doctor gonna do him no good
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.99,0:08:28.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么？ - 因为他中了巫术，就是这样\N{\rEng}- Why's that? - Cause he witched, that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:29.78,c,,0000,0000,0000,,巫术？\N{\rEng}Witched?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:31.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子没脑子\N{\rEng}Child didn't have no sense
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:33.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一直捉弄科拉·费舍尔\N{\rEng}Kept teasing that Cora Fisher
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:37.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,朝她窗户扔石头，留下死东西让她发现\N{\rEng}Throwing rocks at her window, leaving dead things for her to find
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:40.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉他离她远点，大家都知道科拉·费舍尔是个女巫\N{\rEng}Told him he better stay away from her,Everyone knows Cora Fisher be a witch
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你说科拉·费舍尔？\N{\rEng}You said Cora Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆·法雷尔，我真不敢相信\N{\rEng}Tom Ferrell I will be damned
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没死呢\N{\rEng}I ain't dead yet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:50.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到还能在这儿见到你\N{\rEng}Never thought we'd see you around these parts again
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆，多少年了？\N{\rEng}How many years it been, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,有段时间了，我想\N{\rEng}A spell, I reckon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我在门口找到了这个\N{\rEng}I found this in the doorstep
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:09:00.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\rEng}Hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\rEng}Let's see it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:05.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\rEng}Ahh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:09.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,巫术球\N{\rEng}Witch ball
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，我听说过这个\N{\rEng}Yeah, I've I heard of these
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,夫人，就是这个留下了那个印记\N{\rEng}That's what made that mark there, ma'am
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你说是科拉·费舍尔干的？\N{\rEng}You said Cora Fisher did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:22.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么，你认识她？\N{\rEng}Why, you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:23.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,以前认识\N{\rEng}Used to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候她还不是女巫\N{\rEng}She wasn't a witch back then
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:34.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,脱下那男孩的衣服煮了，同时喊着科拉·费舍尔的名字\N{\rEng}Take off that boy's clothes and boil them, calling it out Cora Fisher's name
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:37.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是她下的咒，这样就能破解\N{\rEng}If she's one that witched him, that'll bust the spell
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去那儿，对吧？\N{\rEng}You going up there, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，我想我会去\N{\rEng}Yeah, reckon I will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:46.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不过先去看看我妈妈\N{\rEng}First I'm going to stop by and see my mama
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.82,0:09:50.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，汤姆\N{\rEng}Sorry, Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你知道了\N{\rEng}Figured you knew
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:54.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她，呃\N{\rEng}She's, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:57.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她去世了？\N{\rEng}she's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前了\N{\rEng}Long time now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:03.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她哥哥来接她，带她回东部去了\N{\rEng}Her brother come up to fetch her Took her back East
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:06.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，那不是，呃\N{\rEng}Oh, ain't that, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.01,0:10:09.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那我爸呢？\N{\rEng}what about my daddy, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,再没怎么见过他\N{\rEng}Never did see much of him
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:14.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,自从你离开后就没见过\N{\rEng}Not once since you left
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:16.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,猜他最后是喝酒喝死的\N{\rEng}Guess he finally drunk himself to death
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直都不是个好东西\N{\rEng}He weren't ever much good
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，朋友们，\N{\rEng}Well, friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:24.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,女士，我该走了\N{\rEng}ma'am, I'll be on my way
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下，费雷尔先生\N{\rEng}Just a second, Mr Ferrell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:29.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃，是这个名字吗？\N{\rEng}Um, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:30.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是汤姆\N{\rEng}It's Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:31.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆，\N{\rEng}Tom,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这个女巫，科拉\N{\rEng}this witch, Cora
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以说，呃\N{\rEng}you might say, eh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:37.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这种事情属于我们的\N{\rEng}this sort of thing falls under our
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,专业领域\N{\rEng}sphere of expertise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:43.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你介意我们一起去吗？ - 抱歉，汤姆\N{\rEng}- Do you mind if we come along? - Excuse us Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:46.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，你在干什么？\N{\rEng}Hey What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 实地考察 - 实地考察？\N{\rEng}- Field work - Field work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:50.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你能活着真是幸运\N{\rEng}You're lucky to be alive
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带你回总部，\N{\rEng}I'm taking you back to headquarters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:55.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那才是你该待的地方，在图书馆里，\N{\rEng}where you belong, in the library,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:57.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,把咖啡洒在你那些奇怪的旧书上\N{\rEng}spilling coffee on your weird old books
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有些蹊跷\N{\rEng}There's something going on here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也说过\N{\rEng}You said it yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,"这地方有股味道"\N{\rEng}'This place has the stink'
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:05.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，没错\N{\rEng}Yeah, it does
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.24,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这正是你不该在这里的原因\N{\rEng}It's exactly why you shouldn't be here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:09.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，我需要理解它\N{\rEng}Look, I I need to understand it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:13.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？不是从某本奇怪的旧书里，而是亲身体验\N{\rEng}Okay? And not from some weird old book, but for real
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你一样\N{\rEng}Like you do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:21.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,再说，你真的那么急着告诉布鲁姆我们丢了货物吗？\N{\rEng}Besides, are you really in such a hurry to tell Broom we lost the cargo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们要一起来就快点\N{\rEng}If y'all are coming along you best come along
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.90,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:狂欢乐队的《死者的漫步》]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Dead Man's Stroll' by The Revels]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:30.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 也许你不相信，但必须说出来 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ May not believe it but it has to be told ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:36.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 一个可怜的灵魂在做亡者漫步 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ A poor soul doing the Dead Man's Stroll ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪\N{\r}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪\N{\r}♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\rEng}Ohh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:11:58.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁？\N{\rEng}Who's that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，\N{\rEng}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:06.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你\N{\rEng}look at you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:08.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,眼神恍惚\N{\rEng}all pie-eyed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你来找奥克姆奶奶干什么？\N{\rEng}What you come see,Grammy Oakum for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\N{\rEng}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事？\N{\rEng}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，\N{\rEng}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.53,0:12:23.93,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想知道如何制作女巫球\N{\rEng}they want to know how to make a witch ball
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.93,0:12:25.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，我来告诉你们\N{\rEng}Well, I'll tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这很简单，\N{\rEng}It's easy peasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你要裸体跳舞，\N{\rEng}you dance around,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:31.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一丝不挂\N{\rEng}buck naked
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.19,0:12:33.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,边喊：黄鼠狼的血，\N{\rEng}calling out: Blood of weasel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠的尾巴，\N{\rEng}tail a rat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:39.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,黑猫的内脏和膀胱，\N{\rEng}guts and bladder of a black cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,秃鹰蛋和婴儿指甲，\N{\rEng}buzzard eggs and baby's nails,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:46.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,蟾蜍的脚，\N{\rEng}foot of toad frog,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:48.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,蝙蝠的脑子\N{\rEng}brain of bat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你把锅烧开\N{\rEng}And you put a pot to boil
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:51.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,把这些都放进去\N{\rEng}and it all goes in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,剪下你头上的头发\N{\rEng}Cut some hairs from your head
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,和下面的毛，\N{\rEng}and your nethers,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把它们\N{\rEng}and wrap 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:13:00.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,缠绕在锅里的东西上\N{\rEng}round a gob of stuff from the pot
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:04.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,做成圆形，大小适合投掷\N{\rEng}Make 'em round and a good size for throwing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\rEng}and that's that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人\N{\rEng}You people
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:15.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,想用灵魂换些毒球\N{\rEng}wanna trade your souls for some balls of poison
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:19.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰米·奥克姆说："尽管去做吧"\N{\rEng}Grammy Oakum says: 'Go right at it'
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她会在\N{\rEng}And she'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:25.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱见你们的\N{\rEng}in hell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:34.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,杂志说他们在英国的一座教堂里发现了你\N{\rEng}Magazine said they found you in a church in England
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是这么告诉我的\N{\rEng}So they tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:40.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那没关系\N{\rEng}That's all right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都知道魔鬼是不能踏入教堂的\N{\rEng}Everybody knows the devil can't set foot in no church
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:49.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我其实不是，呃\N{\rEng}You know I'm not actually, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼？\N{\rEng}The devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:52.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，\N{\rEng}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，我见过那个混蛋\N{\rEng}no, I met that son of a bitch
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他长得一点都不像你\N{\rEng}He don't look nothing like you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:13:59.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是科拉的住处\N{\rEng}Here's Cora's place
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:03.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉！\N{\rEng}Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:04.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是汤姆！\N{\rEng}It's Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:06.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆·费雷尔！\N{\rEng}Tom Ferrell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉？\N{\rEng}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:39.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉？\N{\rEng}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.63,0:14:47.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你和这个女孩很熟悉，是吗？\N{\rEng}You knew this girl pretty well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:51.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\rEng}Well
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们，呃，那时还是孩子\N{\rEng}we, uh, we weren't much more than kids
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:56.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是恋人\N{\rEng}We were sweethearts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:58.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,以为我们会\N{\rEng}Figured we'd
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,永远在一起\N{\rEng}always be together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那是很久以前的事了，我想\N{\rEng}It's a long time ago, I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:00.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，姑娘\N{\rEng}Oh, girl
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:02.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么？\N{\rEng}what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:04.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的女巫球\N{\rEng}Great Fucking witch balls
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:11.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有更多\N{\rEng}There's more
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，伙计们？\N{\rEng}Eh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看这个情况?\N{\rEng}What do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.29,0:17:07.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定是出去四处游荡了\N{\rEng}She must be out roaming around
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,只需要等她回来\N{\rEng}Just gotta wait for her to get back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:19.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那应该是她的恶魔使魔\N{\rEng}That'll be her demon familiar, I suspect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:22.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌那些东西\N{\rEng}I hate those
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它们以依附的女巫为食\N{\rEng}They feed on the witch they're attached to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:28.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它们互相吞噬\N{\rEng}They feed off each other
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,女巫和动物\N{\rEng}The witch, the animal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,根据传说,它们作为共生寄生虫运作\N{\rEng}According to the lore, they function as symbiotic parasites
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,传说\N{\rEng}The lore
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:38.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,主啊,求你怜悯\N{\rEng}Lord, have mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲是个女巫\N{\rEng}My mother was a witch
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:48.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌他们在你的杂志里没提到这个小细节,对吧,汤姆?\N{\rEng}I bet they left that little detail out of your magazine, huh, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:49.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯?\N{\rEng}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:52.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未见过我的母亲\N{\rEng}I never met my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:58.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也从未想过见她\N{\rEng}Never wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上\N{\rEng}In fact
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:08.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我所知道的关于女巫的一切\N{\rEng}everything I ever knew about witches
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.97,0:18:11.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我从未知道\N{\rEng}I wish I didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:18.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在来这里的路上你提到你见过魔鬼\N{\rEng}On the way up here you mentioned you saw the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:23.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,大约15年前,\N{\rEng}Some 15 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就在离这里一英里的地方,\N{\rEng}about a mile from this very spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:30.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我来到一条小溪,然后\N{\rEng}come upon a stream, and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.07,0:18:32.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她就在那里\N{\rEng}there she was
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:34.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不,不是魔鬼\N{\rEng}No, not the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.78,c,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多了\N{\rEng}Close enough
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:39.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她的名字叫艾菲·科尔布\N{\rEng}Her name was Effie Kolb
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:41.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我一眼就看出来\N{\rEng}I knew right off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:43.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她会带来麻烦\N{\rEng}she was trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我很惭愧地说\N{\rEng}I'm ashamed to say
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:49.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之后我完全忘记了可怜的科拉·费舍尔\N{\rEng}I forgot all about poor old Cora Fisher after that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你看,艾菲,\N{\rEng}You see, Effie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:55.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她是个女巫,她把我搞得一团糟,\N{\rEng}she was a witch, and she got me all twisted up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:57.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让我觉得也许我也该成为一个女巫\N{\rEng}thinking maybe I ought to be a witch, too
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:02.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,所有那些关于拥有控制他人力量的谈话,\N{\rEng}And all that talk about having power over other folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来真的很诱人\N{\rEng}made it sound real good
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.11,0:19:05.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:08.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,所以,我出去弄来了一只死黑猫\N{\rEng}So, I went out and I got me a dead black cat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:10.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,趁我妈出门时,我在炉子上煮它\N{\rEng}While my Ma was out, I boiled it on the stovetop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,直到它全部分解\N{\rEng}till it went all to pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.20,0:19:14.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我把那团东西带到小溪边,\N{\rEng}Took that mess down to the creek,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:16.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,清洗骨头\N{\rEng}to clean off the bones
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:20.78,c,,0000,0000,0000,,艾菲告诉我当魔鬼出现时我正拿着的那块骨头\N{\rEng}Now Effie told me whatever bone I was holding when the devil showed up
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:25.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那就会成为我的幸运骨\N{\rEng}that was gonna be my lucky bone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,太随意了\N{\rEng}So arbitrary
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:37.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我一眼就认出了他\N{\rEng}I knew him right off
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:40.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我听过关于他的传说一辈子了\N{\rEng}I heard tales about him all my life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:44.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,安塞姆先生，\N{\rEng}Mister Onselm,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一些老人称他为\N{\rEng}some of the old folks called him
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:49.41,c,,0000,0000,0000,,大多数人只叫他"弯曲的人"\N{\rEng}Most just called him the,Crooked Man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:52.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,弯曲的人 呃\N{\rEng}Crooked Man Uhh
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:56.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,据说，安塞姆先生是几百年前\N{\rEng}As story goes, Mr Onselm was one of the first white men
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:58.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,从欧洲来到这里的第一批白人之一\N{\rEng}who came here from Europe hundreds of years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:01.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他在南北战争中两边都参与\N{\rEng}He played both sides in the war between the states
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他成为了一个非常富有的人\N{\rEng}He came to be a very rich man
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:08.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来是个真正聪明的小伙子\N{\rEng}Sounds like a real clever little fella
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:11.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,结果他怎么样了？\N{\rEng}How did that work out for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:16.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说天堂没有太多富人的位置\N{\rEng}They say heaven don't have much room for rich folks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:18.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但下面有很多\N{\rEng}They got plenty down there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把他送回来，\N{\rEng}They sent him back up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让他索取灵魂而不是法定货币\N{\rEng}to claim souls instead of legal tender
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说他拿\N{\rEng}They say he takes a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个铜便士\N{\rEng}a copper penny
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:30.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,作为每个为魔鬼索取的灵魂的报酬\N{\rEng}for every soul he claims for the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:33.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他得到足够多，有一天他会再次变得富有\N{\rEng}He gets enough of them, one day he'll be rich again
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:38.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看一眼老安塞姆先生就把我所有巫术的想法都吓跑了\N{\rEng}One look at old Mr Onselm scared all them witchy thoughts right out of me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:42.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我点着灯回家，一路上发誓要重新做个好人\N{\rEng}Got lit off for home, swearing the whole way to be good again
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:46.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至把那个幸运骨头扔得远远的\N{\rEng}I even took that lucky bone, threw it as far as I could
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不知怎的，我始终无法摆脱它\N{\rEng}Somehow I never could be rid of it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:54.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,回家时我吓坏了，就一直往前跑\N{\rEng}I was so scared when I got home, I just kept right on running
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:56.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这就是我怎么进了军队\N{\rEng}Guess that's how I wound up in the army
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:03.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我熬过来了，\N{\rEng}I come through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:07.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,毫发无损\N{\rEng}without a scratch
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是因为我天生幸运，\N{\rEng}It ain't because I was born lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:12.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,聪明，\N{\rEng}smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:13.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,强壮\N{\rEng}tough
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,恰恰相反\N{\rEng}quite the opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:26.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它有力量\N{\rEng}It's got power in it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:29.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像那个老巫婆说的：\N{\rEng}Just like that old witch said:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它有伤害人的力量\N{\rEng}It's got the power to hurt people
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:34.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但我从未使用过它\N{\rEng}But I never used it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.26,0:21:36.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一次都没有\N{\rEng}Not once
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:40.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我说的，我这辈子从未希望伤害任何人\N{\rEng}Like I said, I never wished harm on anybody my entire life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:44.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是那些拼命想给我打洞的家伙们\N{\rEng}But not even them boys over there trying their damndest to put holes in me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这是不是意味着，我其实不是巫师？\N{\rEng}You think that means,I ain't really a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到什么了吗？\N{\rEng}You hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:10.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.31,0:23:14.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\rEng}No
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:16.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:19.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！妈！\N{\rEng}Ahh! Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.50,0:23:30.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉\N{\rEng}Cora
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:41.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，科拉\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, Cora
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.95,0:23:43.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆，你不该看到我这个样子\N{\rEng}You can't see me like this, Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:44.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘，嘘\N{\rEng}Shh, shh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:45.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不该\N{\rEng}You just can't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.82,0:23:47.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，没事的\N{\rEng}Hey, it's alright
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:48.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，科拉，没事的\N{\rEng}Hey, Cora, it's alright
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.65,0:23:50.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘，嘘\N{\rEng}Shh, Shh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.92,0:23:59.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔，喜欢这外勤工作吗？\N{\rEng}Enjoying that field work, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:01.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么习惯这个的？\N{\rEng}How do you get used to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.41,0:24:05.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带你去火堆旁\N{\rEng}I'm gonna get you by the fire
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:09.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉，你为什么要这么做？嗯？\N{\rEng}Why you done it, Cora? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:11.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那时我是个蠢货，\N{\rEng}I know I was a shit for brains kid back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.59,0:24:13.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但你是聪明的那个\N{\rEng}but you was the smart one
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.29,0:24:15.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你走后，我不知道该怎么办\N{\rEng}After you left, I didn't know what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:18.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我只好跟内特·索斯比在一起\N{\rEng}I had to go up with,Nate Southby
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.29,0:24:20.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们结婚了，但他死了\N{\rEng}We married, but he died
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:23.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的孩子也死了\N{\rEng}Our babies died
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:24.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆，我完全孤单一人\N{\rEng}I was all alone, Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.65,0:24:26.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的，你现在只需要休息，好吗？\N{\rEng}It's alright,You just gotta rest now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.87,0:24:29.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你只需要休息 - 他们要来抓我了\N{\rEng}- You just gotta rest - They're coming for me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.26,0:24:32.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆，他们就在外面 他们想要我的灵魂，他们会得到的\N{\rEng}They're out there, Tom They want my soul, and they gonna have it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.57,0:24:34.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里他们就不行 我在这里就不行\N{\rEng}Not while I'm here Not while,I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:36.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，嘘，嘘，嘘，嘘\N{\rEng}Hey, Shh, shh, shh, shh
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.19,0:24:45.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她在外面！\N{\rEng}She out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.75,0:24:46.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她出去了\N{\rEng}She out
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.84,0:24:47.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘，嘘\N{\rEng}Shh, shh
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.46,0:24:59.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来这里就像个死城\N{\rEng}Looks like Deadsville to me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.82,0:25:06.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\rEng}Ohh
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:15.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，你没事\N{\rEng}Hey, you're alright
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:22.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是谁啊？\N{\rEng}Who's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:25.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我来见的人\N{\rEng}This ain't who I come to see
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.93,0:25:32.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，我真喜欢你的样子\N{\rEng}Well, don't I just like the look of you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.67,0:25:37.20,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她从来就不怎么穿教堂里那种衣服\N{\rEng}She never did have much use for going to church clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:39.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的汤米\N{\rEng}There's my Tommy
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:42.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来一点也不比我上次见她时老\N{\rEng}She don't look a day older than the last time I saw her
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.29,0:25:44.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,要知道一个女巫有多老，\N{\rEng}The only way to tell how old a witch is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.81,0:25:47.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你得砍下她的腿数树轮\N{\rEng}you gotta cut her leg off and count the rings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:50.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米，你回来看我了？\N{\rEng}You come back to see me, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.51,0:25:51.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼，我才不是\N{\rEng}Hell no, I ain't
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.65,0:25:54.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是来见谁的\N{\rEng}You know who I came to see
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.95,0:25:58.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,希望不是那可怜虫科拉·费舍尔\N{\rEng}Not that pitiful thing,Cora Fisher I hope
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.61,0:26:03.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她甚至不值得折磨，但我还是这么做了\N{\rEng}Why, she ain't even much worth tormenting, but I do it all the same
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:10.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个女孩要怎么打发时间呢？\N{\rEng}How's a girl expected to pass the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.23,0:26:17.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米，我不知道你在那个悲惨的小东西身上看到了什么\N{\rEng}I don't know what you ever saw in that tragic little creature, Tommy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.59,0:26:21.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她几乎没有什么灵魂可以偷走\N{\rEng}Why she barely got any soul to steal
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.72,0:26:24.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,别再提她的名字，你这个邪恶的老妓女！\N{\rEng}You keep her name out of your mouth, you wicked old whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.94,0:26:29.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在玩\N{\rEng}I'm just playing
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.86,0:26:36.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我喜欢怎么玩吗，汤姆？\N{\rEng}You 'member how I like to play, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:38.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,记得吗？\N{\rEng}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.21,0:26:41.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你为什么来这里\N{\rEng}I know why you're here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.09,0:26:43.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他也知道\N{\rEng}And he knows it, too
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.31,0:26:45.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他有，\N{\rEng}He got,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.13,0:26:47.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就叫它\N{\rEng}let's just call it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.88,0:26:52.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,和你未了的心愿\N{\rEng}un-finished business with you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:53.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\rEng}I know
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:54.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我打算了结它\N{\rEng}I aim to finish it
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:26:57.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:27:00.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 天啊 - 嘿！\N{\rEng}- Jesus - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.06,0:27:03.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是那个精力旺盛但不太理智的野兔，对吧？\N{\rEng}Still a wild hare with more spunk than sense, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.46,0:27:04.41,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，够了\N{\rEng}Hey that's enough of that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:08.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉你的主人，如果他想伤害这些可怜的人，\N{\rEng}You tell your master if he wants to get to these poor folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.37,0:27:10.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他得先过我这关\N{\rEng}he's gonna have to go through me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.25,0:27:13.07,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你？哈，先生\N{\rEng}You? Ha Mister
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.68,0:27:16.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他一点也不怕你\N{\rEng}he ain't a tiny bit afraid of you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:19.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有，汤姆，\N{\rEng}And Tommy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.04,0:27:20.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点忘了\N{\rEng}I near forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:24.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我给你带个礼物\N{\rEng}He asked me to give you a present
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:27.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.61,0:27:29.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕他看起来不怎么样了\N{\rEng}'Fraid he don't look like much
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.87,0:27:33.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,自从你走后，我每晚都骑他骑得很狠\N{\rEng}I've been riding him pretty hard every night since you left
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.92,0:27:37.93,c,,0000,0000,0000,,猜他差不多被用坏了\N{\rEng}Guess he pretty near wore out
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.93,0:27:39.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的你，艾菲·科尔布！\N{\rEng}Curse you, Effie Kolb!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.49,0:27:40.93,c,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的你！\N{\rEng}Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:42.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能是真的\N{\rEng}This can't be real
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.50,0:27:45.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,放射性的，伙计\N{\rEng}Radioactive, man
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.72,0:27:48.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，\N{\rEng}Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:54.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，不\N{\rEng}Oh, no
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\rEng}No
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.35,0:28:12.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们对你做了什么，爸爸？什么？\N{\rEng}What'd they do to you, Daddy? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.66,0:28:18.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 嘘，嘘，嘘 嘿\N{\rEng}Daddy Shh, shh, shh Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:20.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆\N{\rEng}Tommy
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.66,0:28:22.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗，孩子？\N{\rEng}That's you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.80,0:28:26.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你，你回家了\N{\rEng}You, you come home
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:27.41,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\rEng}You
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.67,0:28:29.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,回来了\N{\rEng}Come
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.55,0:28:34.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，爸爸 我\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, Daddy I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.43,0:28:47.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉？\N{\rEng}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:53.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,沃茨牧师还在山腰上那个小教堂吗？\N{\rEng}Is Reverend Watts still in that little church up on the side of the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.39,0:28:55.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，但你不能去那里，汤姆\N{\rEng}He is, but you can't go up there, Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.31,0:28:58.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到艾菲·科尔布说的了，\N{\rEng}You heard Effie Kolb,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.40,0:29:00.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,弯曲人在等着你\N{\rEng}Crooked Man's waiting on ya
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.49,0:29:03.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是这样\N{\rEng}Maybe he is
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.84,0:29:07.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许这就是我回来的原因\N{\rEng}Maybe that's why I came back
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.89,0:29:11.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我想和那个老魔鬼了结恩怨\N{\rEng}Thought I'd have it out with that old devil
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.02,0:29:16.07,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在我把这个罪人埋在教堂地里之前不行\N{\rEng}Not before I get this sinner buried in church ground
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.11,0:29:21.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，天啊，科拉！\N{\rEng}Oh, my God, Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.55,0:29:24.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦！\N{\rEng}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.52,0:29:35.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\rEng}Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.83,0:29:37.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不想让我压扁吗? - 不,\N{\rEng}- You didn't want me to squash? - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.87,0:29:39.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,压扁很好\N{\rEng}squashing's good
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.35,0:29:40.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全赞同\N{\rEng}Totally approve of that
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.78,0:29:45.91,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:莫里·莫里森管弦乐团和爱丽斯·豪泽的《是你吗》]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Did You' by Morrie Morrison Orchestra ft Alyce Hauser]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:49.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 你曾真心爱过我吗? ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Did you ever really love me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:59.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 你曾真的在乎过吗?\N{\rEng}♪ Did you ever really care?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.64,0:30:06.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 你曾真的想念过我吗? ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Did you ever really miss me? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:10.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 亲吻我,\N{\rEng}♪ Kiss me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.08,0:30:16.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我怀疑你的心是否曾在那里 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ I wonder if your heart was ever there ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.48,0:30:22.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:25.05,c,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 嘘\N{\rEng}Nothing Shh
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:30.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿,试着睡会儿,好吗?\N{\rEng}Hey, try to get some Z's, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.49,0:30:32.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\rEng}Yeah right
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.85,0:30:51.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 还是你真的说了谎 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Or did you really tell a lie ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.77,0:30:58.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 你曾真的\N{\rEng}♪ Did you ever really
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.69,0:31:01.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 真的在乎过吗?\N{\rEng}♪ ever really care?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:08.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 真的爱过我吗?\N{\rEng}♪ Ever really love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.11,0:31:25.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我照看他一会儿吗?\N{\rEng}You want me to take him for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:29.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,是我的罪孽造成的,他是我必须承担的负担\N{\rEng}Oh, it's my sins that done it,He's my burden to carry
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:33.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,换个角度想,\N{\rEng}Think of it a little different,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.86,0:31:37.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为罪孽只是我们本性的一部分\N{\rEng}I think sins are just a part of who we are
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.16,0:31:39.78,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们生来就有,死时也带着它们\N{\rEng}We're born with them and we'll die with them
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.78,0:31:42.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指亚当和夏娃那种原罪吗?\N{\rEng}You mean like a Adam and Eve kind of sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.82,0:31:44.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指那些甩不掉的罪孽\N{\rEng}I mean sins you can't shake
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.17,0:31:46.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,砍掉它们,\N{\rEng}Saw 'em off,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.74,0:31:48.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它们又会长回来\N{\rEng}and they just grow back
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.92,0:31:53.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,当然,我是在打比方\N{\rEng}I'm speaking metaphorically, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.49,0:32:00.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人很友善\N{\rEng}Friendly folks around here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:03.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,都是该死的地球盐\N{\rEng}Salt of the damn earth
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:07.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你能帮我解答一些疑问,科拉\N{\rEng}Maybe you can help me with something, Cora
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.46,0:32:09.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力\N{\rEng}I'll try
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.89,0:32:12.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在研究咒语\N{\rEng}I've been studying spells
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.90,0:32:14.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它们是如何运作的?\N{\rEng}What makes them tick?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.98,0:32:17.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅是说出咒语那么简单,对吧?我是说,\N{\rEng}It's more than just the words, right? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.03,0:32:19.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,单靠咒语本身是没用的\N{\rEng}an incantation on its own does nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:23.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯,就我而言,我把灵魂卖给了魔鬼\N{\rEng}Well, in my case, I sold my mortal soul off to the Devil
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.95,0:32:26.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,所以这可能有助于让事情顺利进行\N{\rEng}So that probably helps grease the wheels some
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.30,0:32:28.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\rEng}Right
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.82,0:32:30.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,除此之外呢?\N{\rEng}Besides that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:38.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,需要触动你的心\N{\rEng}Needs to touch your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:41.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,当我施展诅咒时,\N{\rEng}When I do a hex,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.97,0:32:45.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我会想到最悲伤的事\N{\rEng}I think of the saddest thing I can
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.41,0:32:49.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这似乎能让魔法变得更强大\N{\rEng}That seems to make the magic come on stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.98,0:32:56.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不关我的事,\N{\rEng}Ain't none of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.85,0:32:58.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,女士,\N{\rEng}ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.33,0:33:01.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在尝试使用巫术吗?\N{\rEng}have you been trying to do witch magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.21,0:33:04.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是研究\N{\rEng}It's just research
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.60,0:33:08.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你要非常小心\N{\rEng}You want to be real careful with that
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.28,0:33:30.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,煤矿区\N{\rEng}Coal mining country
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.71,0:33:31.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.24,0:33:34.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,整个地区都是蛇形的隧道\N{\rEng}whole territory's snake full of tunnels
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.24,0:33:36.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这片森林是活的\N{\rEng}If these woods are alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:40.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,隧道就像皮肤下的血管\N{\rEng}tunnels are like veins underneath the skin
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.22,0:33:58.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\rEng}Ohh
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:33:59.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.05,0:34:01.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\rEng}Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.96,0:34:04.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉？科拉？\N{\rEng}Cora? Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.79,0:34:06.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉？\N{\rEng}Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.32,0:34:10.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉！？\N{\rEng}Cora!?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.06,0:34:12.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 科拉？ - 科拉？\N{\rEng}- Cora? - Cora?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.49,0:34:14.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉！\N{\rEng}Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.83,0:34:41.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这很有趣\N{\rEng}That's interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:25.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.75,0:35:41.32,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Arg!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.02,0:35:50.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.81,0:35:52.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.57,0:36:13.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\rEng}Fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.31,0:36:17.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我死了吗？\N{\rEng}Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.75,0:36:21.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\rEng}Maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.50,0:36:31.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\rEng}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.33,0:36:33.24,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那也没关系\N{\rEng}that's all right
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.38,0:36:40.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都知道魔鬼不能踏入教堂\N{\rEng}Everybody knows the devil can't set foot in no church
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.69,0:37:29.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这他妈是什么地方？\N{\rEng}What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.47,0:37:33.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你知道\N{\rEng}I think you know
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:36.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是你妈妈，对吧？\N{\rEng}It's your mama, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.05,0:37:41.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我来说是新闻，我从没见过她的脸\N{\rEng}That's news to me,I've never seen her face
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.19,0:37:48.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，我想那就是她\N{\rEng}Yeah, I guess that's her
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:52.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她试图逃避为那些罪孽付出代价\N{\rEng}She tried to get out of paying for all them sins
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.97,0:37:55.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,现在她将永无宁日，备受折磨\N{\rEng}Now she'll have no rest from tormenting
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.63,0:38:00.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她已经很多天没睡过觉了，多到我数不清\N{\rEng}She ain't slept a wink for more days than I know how to count
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.07,0:38:05.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,罪孽？\N{\rEng}Sins?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.07,0:38:08.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,应该没那么严重吧，\N{\rEng}They couldn't have been that bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.29,0:38:09.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧？\N{\rEng}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:14.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,罪孽众多。与恶魔勾结，\N{\rEng}They were many Consorted with demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.52,0:38:19.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,骑着黑山羊飞行，参加魔鬼聚会，\N{\rEng}flew upon the black goat and gave herself for the Sabbat,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.00,0:38:22.05,c,,0000,0000,0000,,变形成害虫，\N{\rEng}changed her shape into that of varmints,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.05,0:38:24.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,和一些说不出名字的东西\N{\rEng}and things unnameable
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.53,0:38:31.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\rEng}He's here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.81,0:38:44.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\rEng}Wow
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.50,0:38:46.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一只该死的大鸟\N{\rEng}That's a big fucking bird
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.81,0:38:48.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,野兽有许多形态，\N{\rEng}Beast takes many forms,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:50.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是其中之一\N{\rEng}this be but one
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.21,0:38:52.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\rEng}Sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.51,0:38:55.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,莎拉\N{\rEng}Sarah
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.82,0:38:57.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼？\N{\rEng}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.30,0:38:59.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.09,0:39:02.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,怜悯我\N{\rEng}Mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.74,0:39:08.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你原谅我，让我去见上帝吧\N{\rEng}If you will forgive me, let me go up to God
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.35,0:39:10.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,去见上帝？\N{\rEng}To God?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.49,0:39:14.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不 这里才是你应该待的地方\N{\rEng}No This is where you belong
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.27,0:39:16.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我的主\N{\rEng}My Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.14,0:39:17.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我的主人\N{\rEng}My master
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.76,0:39:21.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我还能给你什么呢？\N{\rEng}What more can I give thee?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.28,0:39:23.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多\N{\rEng}So much more
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.59,0:39:28.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉不到体内正在孕育新的生命吗？\N{\rEng}Can you not feel the new life growing inside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.77,0:39:31.07,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能吧？\N{\rEng}It can't be possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.07,0:39:32.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个黑暗的东西\N{\rEng}A dark thing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.16,0:39:34.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的\N{\rEng}Malignant
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.82,0:39:37.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能，因为我已经死了\N{\rEng}It can't be for I am dead
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.17,0:39:40.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你向漆黑的夜晚歌唱，\N{\rEng}You sang out to the deep of night,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:42.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,夜晚的生物回应了你\N{\rEng}and the night things answered
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:47.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你将给这个世界一份礼物\N{\rEng}Now you will give the world a gift
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.05,0:39:52.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一份礼物\N{\rEng}A gift
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.62,0:39:54.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个儿子\N{\rEng}A son
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.75,0:40:02.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个美丽的儿子\N{\rEng}A beautiful son
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.59,0:40:11.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\rEng}Ow
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.33,0:40:14.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哇，慢点，慢点\N{\rEng}Woah, easy there, easy
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.81,0:40:16.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\rEng}I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.68,0:40:21.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦天啊，我的头感觉像是被米尼·米诺索击中了一样\N{\rEng}Oh shit, my head feels like,Minnie Minoso took a swing at it
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.69,0:40:22.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\rEng}Ahh
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.47,0:40:24.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他把你带回来了\N{\rEng}He brought you back
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.87,0:40:30.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉 科拉！\N{\rEng}Cora Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.62,0:40:44.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉！\N{\rEng}Cora!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.63,0:40:50.24,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉\N{\rEng}Cora
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.99,0:41:09.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我用了它\N{\rEng}I used it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.13,0:41:12.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我用了那个幸运骨头\N{\rEng}I used the lucky bone
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.48,0:41:15.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我之前不是女巫的话\N{\rEng}If I wasn't a witch before
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.79,0:41:19.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我肯定是了\N{\rEng}I surely am now
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.30,0:41:56.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,给你，爸爸\N{\rEng}There you go, Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是圣地\N{\rEng}It's consecrated ground
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.87,0:42:00.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把你带进去吧，你这个老罪人\N{\rEng}Let's get you inside, you old sinner
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:20.20,c,,0000,0000,0000,,牧师\N{\rEng}Reverend
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.55,0:42:27.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是你吗？汤姆·费雷尔？\N{\rEng}That you? Tom Ferrell?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.16,0:42:32.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的，牧师？\N{\rEng}How'd you know, Reverend?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.04,0:42:33.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉我的\N{\rEng}She told me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.21,0:42:35.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她？\N{\rEng}She?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.26,0:42:36.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个女孩\N{\rEng}There's a girl here
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.95,0:42:40.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在你们来之前几分钟进来的 大胆得很\N{\rEng}Come in a couple of minutes before you fellas Bold as brass
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.83,0:42:45.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到她吗？\N{\rEng}You don't see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.01,0:42:50.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，\N{\rEng}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.27,0:42:52.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许她是个幽灵\N{\rEng}maybe she a ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.58,0:42:55.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是科拉·费雪吗？\N{\rEng}Is it Cora Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:57.24,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉·费雪？\N{\rEng}Cora Fisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:42:59.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\rEng}Yep
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.93,0:43:03.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得她还是个小蝌蚪的时候\N{\rEng}Remember her when she was just a little tadpole
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:06.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼可能得到了她的身体，\N{\rEng}Devil might have got a body,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.90,0:43:10.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但没有得到她的灵魂\N{\rEng}but he didn't get her soul
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.64,0:43:18.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是你爸爸，对吧？\N{\rEng}It's y'daddy, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.00,0:43:22.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他应该被安葬在适当的教堂墓地里\N{\rEng}Figured he ought to be buried in proper church ground
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.91,0:43:25.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那就这样吧\N{\rEng}So he shall
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.26,0:43:27.05,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好的，爸爸\N{\rEng}All right, Daddy
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.92,0:43:38.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想你来飓风山还有另一个目的，对吧？\N{\rEng}But I think you got another purpose for being up here on the Hurricane, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.49,0:43:39.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，先生\N{\rEng}Yes, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.23,0:43:41.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们，呃，\N{\rEng}We, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.63,0:43:44.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目标是爬上那座山\N{\rEng}we aim to go up that hill
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.98,0:43:46.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要去他的房子？\N{\rEng}You're going to his house?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.24,0:43:52.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,现在，为什么有人会想做这种蠢事呢？\N{\rEng}Now, why would any damn fool want to do a thing like that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.13,0:44:05.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲死了\N{\rEng}My daddy's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.09,0:44:07.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,科拉\N{\rEng}Cora
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.78,0:44:10.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你死了\N{\rEng}You're dead
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.74,0:44:14.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉，姑娘\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, girl
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.70,0:44:18.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许唯一能做的就是向他投降\N{\rEng}Maybe all that's left to do is surrender myself to him
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.14,0:44:20.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他，拿走我的身体，\N{\rEng}Tell him, take my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.36,0:44:22.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,拿走我的灵魂，\N{\rEng}take my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.19,0:44:25.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,拿走你该死的一分钱\N{\rEng}take your goddamn penny
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.41,0:44:30.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我的良心上不再有杀戮\N{\rEng}Just so long as there's no more killing on my conscience
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.11,0:44:33.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟，交易就是交易，不是吗？\N{\rEng}After all, a deal's a deal, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.11,0:44:34.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这太荒谬了\N{\rEng}That's ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.64,0:44:36.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你那时只是个孩子，与恶魔实体的交易？\N{\rEng}You were just a kid,A deal with a demonic entity?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.86,0:44:38.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能具有约束力？\N{\rEng}How can that possibly be binding?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.60,0:44:41.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦，它是有约束力的 - 地狱男爵\N{\rEng}- Oh, it be binding - Hellboy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.25,0:44:44.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，它某种程度上是有约束力的\N{\rEng}Yeah, it's kind of binding
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.26,0:44:48.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,听着，可能还有一些回旋的余地\N{\rEng}Look, there may be some wiggle room
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.26,0:44:49.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我来这里的原因\N{\rEng}It's what I'm here for
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.74,0:44:51.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,重新谈判\N{\rEng}To renegotiate
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.57,0:44:53.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,谈判个屁\N{\rEng}Negotiate, my ass
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.92,0:44:58.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，他看起来像个很有说服力的家伙，牧师，不是吗？\N{\rEng}Well, he do seem like a pretty persuasive fella, Reverend, don't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.53,0:45:01.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,人的骄傲和愚蠢，就是这样\N{\rEng}Men's pride and folly, all that is
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.71,0:45:06.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，如果你们要去，最好在太阳高挂天空时去\N{\rEng}Well, if you're gonna go, best do it when the sun's up in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.15,0:45:08.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他的力量在黑暗中最强\N{\rEng}His power's strongest when it's dark
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.15,0:45:10.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你们今晚就在这里过夜吧\N{\rEng}Y'all stay here tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.72,0:45:12.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶紧走了，牧师\N{\rEng}We got to boogie-woogie, preach
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.20,0:45:15.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来我们还有一些日光\N{\rEng}Looks like we still have some daylight left
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.42,0:45:17.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗？\N{\rEng}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.17,0:45:30.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那，那，不，等等，那是不可能的\N{\rEng}That, that's, no, wait, that's not possible
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.00,0:45:33.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，地球，地球不会旋转。它，它，不是这样运作的\N{\rEng}No, the Earth, the Earth doesn't spin It, it, that's not how it works
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.18,0:45:40.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在飓风中是按他的时间来的\N{\rEng}We on his time up in the,Hurricane
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:52.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有同伴了\N{\rEng}We've got company
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.76,0:45:55.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这些地方周围有很多女巫\N{\rEng}A lot of witches around these parts
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.67,0:45:57.20,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都有\N{\rEng}Always have been
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.63,0:46:00.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,以前也有很多普通人\N{\rEng}Used to be plenty of regular folks, too
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.85,0:46:04.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如今，大多数都是女巫\N{\rEng}Nowadays, mostly just witches
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.56,0:46:12.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈！哈利路亚\N{\rEng}Haha! Hallelujah
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.08,0:46:16.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要引导盲人走他们不知道的路\N{\rEng}And I will lead the blind by a way they know not
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.70,0:46:23.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要为他们把黑暗变为光明\N{\rEng}And I will make the darkness light for them
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.27,0:46:29.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,把弯曲的地方变直\N{\rEng}And the crooked things straight
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.40,0:46:31.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,俄涅洛斯和诺特\N{\rEng}Oneiros und Nótt
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.23,0:46:35.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你们的眼睛\N{\rEng}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.72,0:46:41.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,需要触动你的心\N{\rEng}Needs to touch your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.59,0:46:44.20,c,,0000,0000,0000,,当我施咒时\N{\rEng}When I do a hex
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.29,0:46:48.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我会想到我能想到的最悲伤的事\N{\rEng}I think of the saddest thing I can
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.38,0:46:52.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不要让你们的心烦恼\N{\rEng}Let not your hearts be troubled
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:59.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那些女巫不能踏足这片圣地\N{\rEng}Them witches Can't set foot on this holy ground
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:02.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,而那黑魔法\N{\rEng}And that black magic
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:04.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里也没有用\N{\rEng}Ain't no good here
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:07.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们很快就会知道了\N{\rEng}I guess we'll find out soon enough
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:13.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子，你怀疑祈祷的力量吗？\N{\rEng}You doubt the power of prayers, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.76,0:47:23.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是喜欢随身携带一些超高口径的弹药\N{\rEng}I just like to have some excessively high-caliber ammo on hand
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.50,0:47:26.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一\N{\rEng}Just in case
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.29,0:47:33.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦！哇！\N{\rEng}Oh! Sheee Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.45,0:47:55.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米\N{\rEng}Tommy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.79,0:47:57.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘘！\N{\rEng}Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.45,0:47:59.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米\N{\rEng}Tommy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.84,0:48:02.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在里面能听到我\N{\rEng}I know you can hear me in there
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.63,0:48:05.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天还没遇到够麻烦吗？\N{\rEng}Ain't you had enough trouble for one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.98,0:48:10.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦才刚刚开始呢\N{\rEng}It ain't even really begun
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.03,0:48:14.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你所有在教堂里的朋友，\N{\rEng}All your friends in that church with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.81,0:48:17.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都会死\N{\rEng}they all gonna die
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.25,0:48:20.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为你\N{\rEng}All on your account
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.47,0:48:24.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么你必须出来面对他\N{\rEng}That's why you gotta come out and face him
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.28,0:48:49.24,c,,0000,0000,0000,,猫王的屁股都没抖得这么厉害\N{\rEng}Elvis's ass don't shake this hard
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.24,0:48:52.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,牧师，煤矿是不是就在这座教堂下面？\N{\rEng}Reverend, the coal mines, do they run under this church?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.16,0:48:54.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，它们遍布各处\N{\rEng}Oh, they run everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.90,0:49:01.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,大约30年前发生过一次煤矿坍塌 上一次地面这样摇晃时\N{\rEng}A coal mine collapsed about 30 years ago Last time the ground shook like this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.77,0:49:03.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,100人丧生\N{\rEng}100 men killed
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.86,0:49:05.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,被活埋了\N{\rEng}Buried alive
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.12,0:49:07.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个建教堂的好地方，是吧，乔？\N{\rEng}Great place to build a church, huh, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.26,0:49:10.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆在哪？\N{\rEng}Where's Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.35,0:49:18.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白有什么好笑的\N{\rEng}I don't see what's so godforsaken funny
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.63,0:50:22.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,小汤姆·法瑞尔，回来见我了\N{\rEng}Little Tom Ferrell, come back to see me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.46,0:50:26.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,把我的幸运骨头带来\N{\rEng}Bring me my lucky bone
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.77,0:50:31.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我来取回它了，汤姆·法瑞尔\N{\rEng}I come to collect it, Tom Ferrell
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.47,0:50:34.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，我会把它给你\N{\rEng}Yeah and I'm gonna give it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.00,0:50:36.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你得答应我一件事\N{\rEng}You gotta make me one promise
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.35,0:50:40.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不要伤害那些在里面的好人\N{\rEng}No harm comes to those good folks in there
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.92,0:50:45.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但是是你把他们置于危险之中的，\N{\rEng}But it was you who put them in harms way,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.31,0:50:48.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不是我\N{\rEng}not I
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.32,0:51:00.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，那么\N{\rEng}All right, then
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.11,0:51:05.07,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\rEng}All right
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.40,0:51:30.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不这么认为\N{\rEng}I don't think so
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.66,0:51:36.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看，我不喜欢这个交易\N{\rEng}See, I don't like this deal
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.75,0:51:38.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你太想要它了，\N{\rEng}You want it too bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.15,0:51:40.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这让我不想让你得到它\N{\rEng}and that makes me not want you to have it
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.54,0:51:44.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,进去吧，汤姆\N{\rEng}Go on inside, Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.37,0:51:45.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\rEng}Go
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.85,0:51:50.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,喂,你可真是个丑陋的狗娘养的。\N{\rEng}Well, ain't you a pug-ugly son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.90,0:51:54.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这话说的好像五十步笑百步,但是\N{\rEng}Pot calling the kettle black here, but
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.21,0:51:57.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\rEng}Jesus H
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.79,0:52:09.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,对了\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah, that's right
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.70,0:52:14.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,树上那个色情狂女人说你不怕我\N{\rEng}The nympho-broad in the tree mentioned you weren't afraid of me
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.49,0:52:18.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那你猜怎么着?我也不怕你\N{\rEng}Well guess what? I'm not afraid of you either
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.40,0:52:21.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你为什么不转身,\N{\rEng}So why don't you turn around,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.36,0:52:24.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,带着你那歪斜的屁股滚出这里,还有那些头晕目眩的婊子们\N{\rEng}take your crooked ass out of here, and take those dizzy bitches with you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.24,0:52:28.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前的表现很不一样\N{\rEng}You had a different aspect
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.85,0:52:31.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,当你看着你母亲被烧死的时候\N{\rEng}when you watched your mother burn
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.90,0:52:34.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈在说什么,橡皮泥?\N{\rEng}What the hell you say, Gumby?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.64,0:52:38.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,从这个教堂滚出去,安瑟姆先生 你现在就滚\N{\rEng}Be gone from this church, Mr Onselm You be gone now
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:40.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到她的样子了\N{\rEng}You saw how she is
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.91,0:52:44.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这个悲伤的东西\N{\rEng}This sorrowful thing
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.08,0:52:48.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,她受苦了那么多\N{\rEng}She suffers so
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.70,0:52:55.05,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有能力缓解她的痛苦\N{\rEng}But I have it in my power to mollify her pain
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.05,0:52:59.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让她有羽毛的灵魂展翅高飞\N{\rEng}Let her feathered soul take wing
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.31,0:53:00.71,c,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗?\N{\rEng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.71,0:53:02.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你会这么做?\N{\rEng}You would do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.62,0:53:04.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\rEng}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.15,0:53:07.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要求你回报一点小事\N{\rEng}Something small in return is all I ask
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:13.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是扭下那个小汤姆·法瑞尔的头\N{\rEng}That you twist off the head of that little Tom Ferrell
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.15,0:53:14.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,然后把它带到这里来\N{\rEng}And bring it hither
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.46,0:53:18.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是\N{\rEng}We're just
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.68,0:53:20.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在重新谈判\N{\rEng}renegotiating
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.69,0:53:28.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我们可以达成共识\N{\rEng}I'm sure we can see eye to eye
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.56,0:53:31.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.09,0:53:34.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你体内流着巫师的血,朋友\N{\rEng}You got witch blood in you, friend
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.48,0:53:39.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你更像我\N{\rEng}You're more like me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.83,0:53:41.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是像他们\N{\rEng}than you are like them
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.88,0:53:45.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧,蛇,让我们战斗吧\N{\rEng}Come on, snake, let's rattle
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.34,0:54:07.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦!\N{\rEng}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.43,0:54:15.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮他\N{\rEng}Help him
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.57,0:54:21.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,来啊!\N{\rEng}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.15,0:54:36.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦!他死定了 他肯定死了\N{\rEng}Oh! He's kilt He's kilt for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.24,0:54:40.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!我没死\N{\rEng}Arg! I ain't kilt
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.85,0:54:45.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能永远躲在那里,汤米\N{\rEng}You can't hide in there forever, Tommy
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.20,0:54:49.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,歪曲人会耗尽你的力气,小子\N{\rEng}Crooked Man gonna wear you out, boy
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.77,0:54:52.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦,闭上你那该死的嘴\N{\rEng}Oh, you shut your cursed mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.52,0:54:56.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他会给你带来比你那醉鬼\N{\rEng}He gonna heap sorrows on you a hundred times worse than what you drunken
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.95,0:54:58.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,爹爹还要糟糕百倍的悲伤\N{\rEng}daddy ever got
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.70,0:55:03.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,从我的脑子里滚出去,你这个女巫!女巫!从我的脑子里滚出去!\N{\rEng}You get out of my skull, you witch! Witch! Get out of my skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.40,0:55:05.05,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊!\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:08.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔,\N{\rEng}Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.23,0:55:11.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你\N{\rEng}I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.01,0:55:12.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,牧师\N{\rEng}Reverend
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.54,0:55:17.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道,牧师,交易就是交易\N{\rEng}Now we both know, Reverend, a deal's a deal
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.41,0:55:20.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我会这样做\N{\rEng}Here's what I'll do
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.89,0:55:25.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我会从你那里买下那块幸运骨头\N{\rEng}I'll buy that lucky bone from you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.50,0:55:29.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有东西可以卖给你，安塞姆先生\N{\rEng}Ain't nothing in here for sale to you, Mr Onselm
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.82,0:55:32.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,做吧\N{\rEng}Do it
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.43,0:55:35.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\rEng}Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.34,0:55:36.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃！啊！\N{\rEng}Urmm! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.86,0:55:40.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧，乔，你得再用力拉\N{\rEng}Come on, Joe, you gotta pull harder
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.43,0:55:41.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 加油！ - 啊！\N{\rEng}- Come on! - Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.30,0:55:47.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃，我知道你不需要法定货币，老头\N{\rEng}Uhh, I know you got no use for legal tender, old man
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.44,0:55:50.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但时间呢？\N{\rEng}But what about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.44,0:55:53.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你会给多少\N{\rEng}What do you give for
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.05,0:55:55.75,c,,0000,0000,0000,,十年的时间？\N{\rEng}ten years of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.75,0:55:58.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,撒旦，你对我做了什么？\N{\rEng}What are you doing to me, Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.62,0:55:59.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\rEng}How about
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.63,0:56:00.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,二十年呢？\N{\rEng}twenty?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.37,0:56:03.41,c,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便把你的\N{\rEng}Fix up those
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.41,0:56:06.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛也修复了\N{\rEng}eyes of yours while we're at it
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:12.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧！\N{\rEng}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.56,0:56:20.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不行，先生！我的年岁和病痛都是自然而来的，\N{\rEng}No, sir! I come fairly by my years and my afflictions,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.17,0:56:22.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要别的东西\N{\rEng}and I don't want nothing else
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.22,0:56:33.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,艾比·赖利毒死了两个丈夫，她是怎么被埋在教堂墓地的？\N{\rEng}Abby Riley done poisoned two husbands,How'd she get planted in a church yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:44.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这片圣地里埋葬了太多罪人\N{\rEng}So many sinners in this consecrated ground
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.60,0:57:01.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,肉体腐烂，但罪孽永存\N{\rEng}Flesh rots, but the sin goes on
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.92,0:57:20.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\rEng}Oh shit
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.45,0:57:22.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，你确定你没事吗？因为\N{\rEng}Okay, are you sure you're okay? Because
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.53,0:57:24.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你想把手指伸进去吗？\N{\rEng}You want to stick your finger in?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.19,0:57:25.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，我不想\N{\rEng}No I do not
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.23,0:57:26.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能一直这样流血\N{\rEng}You can't keep bleeding like this
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.63,0:57:27.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\rEng}I'll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.89,0:57:30.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不，不，你不会没事的 - 芭比·乔\N{\rEng}- No, no, you will not be fine - Bobbie Jo
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.02,0:57:31.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是工作的一部分\N{\rEng}Part of the job
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.80,0:57:36.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？我迫不及待要抓住那个混蛋\N{\rEng}Okay? I can't wait to get my hands on that Howdy Doody fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.92,0:58:01.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好戏不断上演\N{\rEng}Where the hits just keep on coming
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.08,0:58:29.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来有点不一样，是吗？\N{\rEng}He looks a little different, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.60,0:58:30.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼\N{\rEng}Mm-hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.56,0:58:37.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直喜欢漂亮姑娘，是吗，牧师？\N{\rEng}You always did like them pretty girls, didn't you, Reverend?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.78,0:58:43.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到你在做礼拜日讲道时一直盯着我看\N{\rEng}I could feel your eyes on me giving them Sunday sermons
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.36,0:58:48.93,c,,0000,0000,0000,,回去躺下吧，艾比盖尔，这不再是你的世界了\N{\rEng}You go lay back down, Abigail,This ain't your world no more
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.97,0:58:55.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,吻我吧，神父\N{\rEng}Kiss me, Father
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.06,0:58:58.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,像你一直想要的那样吻我\N{\rEng}Kiss me like you always wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.98,0:59:02.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,吻这个吧\N{\rEng}Kiss this
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:13.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么？\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.52,0:59:16.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,卡莉·希克斯，通奸者\N{\rEng}Callie Hicks, fornicator
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.52,0:59:18.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,通奸者！\N{\rEng}Fornicator!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.09,0:59:25.88,c,,0000,0000,0000,,艾贝尔·雅各布斯\N{\rEng}Abel Jacobs
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.88,0:59:27.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,赌徒\N{\rEng}Gambler
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.49,0:59:30.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔西·沃德\N{\rEng}Josie Ward
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.92,0:59:33.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,风流者\N{\rEng}Philanderer
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.41,0:59:38.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,曼利·兰格里什\N{\rEng}Manly Langrishe
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.28,0:59:40.98,c,,0000,0000,0000,,醉醺醺地躺着\N{\rEng}Lying drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.98,0:59:42.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,醉醺醺地躺着！\N{\rEng}Lying drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.55,0:59:50.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,内森·格林\N{\rEng}Nathan Green
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.29,0:59:54.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,杀人犯\N{\rEng}Murderer
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.82,0:59:56.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,像县集市上的鸭子\N{\rEng}Like ducks at the county fair
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.86,0:59:58.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,弗洛拉·苏·贝克\N{\rEng}Flora Sue Baker
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.26,1:00:00.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,出轨的妓女\N{\rEng}Cheatin' whore
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.91,1:00:03.78,c,,0000,0000,0000,,出轨的妓女\N{\rEng}Cheatin' whore
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:05.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,艾达·考德\N{\rEng}Ada Calder
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.44,1:00:09.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,杀害儿童的凶手\N{\rEng}Child killer
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.62,1:00:18.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经死了，被埋葬了\N{\rEng}They were dead, and buried
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.10,1:00:19.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,罪过被宽恕了\N{\rEng}Sins were forgiven
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.23,1:00:22.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,宽恕不等于遗忘\N{\rEng}Forgiven don't mean forgotten
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.28,1:00:25.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,怀亚特·费雷尔\N{\rEng}Wyatt Ferrell
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.85,1:00:27.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,醉醺醺的老傻瓜\N{\rEng}Drunken old fool
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.37,1:00:30.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈哈\N{\rEng}Ha ha ha
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.42,1:00:31.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\rEng}Agsk
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.38,1:00:33.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃！\N{\rEng}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.25,1:00:35.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？\N{\rEng}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.12,1:00:40.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，等等，等等\N{\rEng}No, wait, wait
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.91,1:00:46.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\rEng}Fuck
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.36,1:01:05.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，爸爸\N{\rEng}Sorry Daddy
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.76,1:01:09.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,主啊，我再也不想看这个了\N{\rEng}Lord, I can't look on this no more
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.11,1:01:12.20,c,,0000,0000,0000,,带走我的眼睛吧\N{\rEng}Take my eyes away
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.90,1:01:16.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要魔鬼的任何礼物\N{\rEng}And I don't want no gifts from the devil
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.34,1:01:25.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢主\N{\rEng}Thank you, Lord
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.31,1:01:39.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆·费雷尔！\N{\rEng}Tom Ferrell!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.31,1:01:41.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个旧猫骨头给我！\N{\rEng}Give me that old cat bone!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.40,1:01:43.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没打算用它，牧师\N{\rEng}I was never gonna use it, Reverend
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.45,1:01:46.45,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我并不是个完美的人\N{\rEng}You watch now I ain't no perfect man
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不是\N{\rEng}None of us is
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.23,1:01:51.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我心里和其他人一样也有阴影\N{\rEng}I got a shadow in my heart like anyone else
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.93,1:01:54.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,但你会看到那道光的，汤姆·费雷尔\N{\rEng}But you gonna see that light, Tom Ferrell
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.46,1:02:00.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你会让它在你内心灿烂地燃烧\N{\rEng}You gonna let it blaze bright inside of you
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.46,1:02:03.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像那道光在我心中燃烧一样\N{\rEng}Just like that light be blazing in me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.56,1:02:15.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我热血沸腾\N{\rEng}I'm all fired up
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.13,1:02:18.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把那邪恶彻底打开\N{\rEng}I'm gonna bust that evil wide open
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.13,1:02:19.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要挤压它\N{\rEng}I'm gonna squeeze it
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.48,1:02:23.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把圣灵挤进\N{\rEng}I'm gonna squeeze the,Holy Spirit
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.53,1:02:28.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这个邪恶的不幸骨头里！\N{\rEng}into this vile unlucky bone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.01,1:02:30.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到\N{\rEng}I can feel it
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.10,1:02:33.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看它燃烧吧，汤姆·费雷尔\N{\rEng}Look at it blaze, Tom Ferrell
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.19,1:02:34.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊！\N{\rEng}Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.46,1:02:41.24,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这院子里的每一个坟墓\N{\rEng}Every grave in this yards
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.51,1:02:43.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,都是用这把铲子挖的\N{\rEng}been dug with this shovel
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.08,1:02:49.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它不充满上帝\N{\rEng}If it ain't full of God
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.73,1:02:52.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那就没有什么是充满上帝的\N{\rEng}then nothing is
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.39,1:03:02.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你的杖，你的竿！\N{\rEng}Thy rod and thy staff!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.01,1:03:05.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它们安慰我\N{\rEng}They comfort me
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.05,1:03:07.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这能行\N{\rEng}That'll work
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.06,1:03:14.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\rEng}Yep
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.84,1:03:58.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他要回家了\N{\rEng}He's going home
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.24,1:04:02.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊-啊 地狱男爵，不要\N{\rEng}Ah-ah Hellboy, no
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.11,1:04:05.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们报告情况然后带着局里的整个团队回来\N{\rEng}We call this in and come back with the whole team from the bureau
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:07.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,最好现在就解决他，他受伤了\N{\rEng}Better to finish this,He's hurt
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.37,1:04:08.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他很虚弱\N{\rEng}He's weak
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.51,1:04:10.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔，你完事了\N{\rEng}Joe, you're done
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.59,1:04:12.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,留在这里陪牧师\N{\rEng}Staying back here with the Reverend
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.73,1:04:14.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 我们不回来了，\N{\rEng}- No - We don't come back,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.90,1:04:18.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你继续下山，一直走到找到电话为止\N{\rEng}you keep going down that mountain and you don't stop until you find a telephone
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.95,1:04:21.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不要回到这里\N{\rEng}Don't ever come back here
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.65,1:04:26.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.14,1:04:34.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,带上铲子\N{\rEng}Keep the shovel
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.00,1:04:39.92,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:宾利乐队的《魔法海》]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Enchanted Sea' by The Bentleys]
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.72,1:04:50.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知它一直被这么称呼\N{\rEng}It's been called that since I can remember
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.85,1:04:54.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前，一场飓风吹倒了这座山上的一片树林\N{\rEng}A long time back a hurricane blew down a mess of trees on this mountain
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.12,1:04:56.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它们再也没有长回来\N{\rEng}They never grew back
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.12,1:04:59.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还活着的人没人记得那件事\N{\rEng}No one still alive remembers it
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.47,1:05:02.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,可能已经是一千年前的事了，我也不清楚\N{\rEng}Might have been a thousand years ago for all I know
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.17,1:05:04.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,而且，说不定根本就不是什么飓风\N{\rEng}And hell, maybe it wasn't no hurricane at all
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.56,1:05:06.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说？\N{\rEng}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.30,1:05:07.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，\N{\rEng}Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.09,1:05:10.22,c,,0000,0000,0000,,印第安人说这里一直都不太平\N{\rEng}the Indians say it's always been bad
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.70,1:05:14.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们说这里有比大洪水还要古老的鬼魂和生物\N{\rEng}They say there's ghosts and critters up here older than the flood
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.31,1:05:18.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,稀有动物，山怪精灵\N{\rEng}Scarce animals,Shonokins Mountain spirits
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.88,1:05:20.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说，\N{\rEng}Here me out,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.36,1:05:24.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能在胡说八道，但是\N{\rEng}I might be just talking out of my ass here, but
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.15,1:05:27.41,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可能面对的是维度裂缝\N{\rEng}might be looking at a dimensional rifting
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.71,1:05:30.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,洛夫克拉夫特式的场景\N{\rEng}Lovecraft type scenario
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.80,1:05:34.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,古老的神明强行进入我们世界那种情况\N{\rEng}The old gods forcing their way into our world type thing
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.72,1:05:36.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我对那些一无所知，但是\N{\rEng}I don't know nothing about that, but
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.85,1:05:39.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对是个诡异、邪恶的地方，这是肯定的\N{\rEng}it's a queer, bad feeling place, that's for sure
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.17,1:05:52.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,需要一把新铲子了\N{\rEng}Gonna need a new shovel
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.74,1:05:56.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这些山里有些东西\N{\rEng}Something in these hills
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.96,1:05:58.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,某种闹鬼的东西\N{\rEng}Something haunted
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.53,1:06:00.09,c,,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的\N{\rEng}Evil
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.40,1:06:01.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在树木里\N{\rEng}In the trees
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.57,1:06:02.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在泥土里\N{\rEng}In the dirt
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.67,1:06:10.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆说这些山就像一个活物\N{\rEng}Tom said these hills were like a living thing
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.11,1:06:13.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍？\N{\rEng}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.85,1:06:16.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他说那些老矿井就像它的循环系统\N{\rEng}He said the old mines were like its circulatory system
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.85,1:06:18.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它的血管在地下蔓延\N{\rEng}Its veins running underground
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.07,1:06:21.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得弯腰人\N{\rEng}The Crooked Man, I think,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.33,1:06:24.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是从中汲取力量的\N{\rEng}I think he draws power from it
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.90,1:06:26.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘，你是不是有什么想法？\N{\rEng}You got something on your mind, girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.69,1:06:28.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个不太好的想法\N{\rEng}Something I don't like
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.21,1:06:31.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许如果我们破坏了力量源，就能伤害到他\N{\rEng}Maybe if we disrupt the power source, we can hurt him
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.21,1:06:32.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.48,1:06:44.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是破坏行动\N{\rEng}I'm talking about sabotage
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.01,1:06:47.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是场战争，那些隧道是补给线，我们会埋炸药\N{\rEng}If this were a war and those tunnels were supply lines, we'd plant dynamite
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.19,1:06:50.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你要炸毁那个矿井吗？\N{\rEng}You gonna dynamite that mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.28,1:06:51.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\rEng}No
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.67,1:06:54.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许有更好的办法\N{\rEng}Maybe something better
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.67,1:06:55.80,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个咒语\N{\rEng}A spell
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.02,1:06:59.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘，\N{\rEng}Girl,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.81,1:07:02.42,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈疯了吗\N{\rEng}You outta your mother fucking mind
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.73,1:07:12.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这是否是真的，\N{\rEng}I didn't know if it was real,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.39,1:07:16.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还是只是用来吓唬小孩子的故事\N{\rEng}or if it was just a story they tell little chaps to scare them
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.96,1:07:23.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了吗？\N{\rEng}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.00,1:07:26.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也给我讲过这些故事\N{\rEng}They told me them stories too
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.43,1:07:58.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,可以用点女人的手段\N{\rEng}Could use a woman's touch
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.62,1:08:13.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们下到那些矿井里\N{\rEng}They go down into them mines
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.19,1:08:20.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让我理解一下\N{\rEng}Make me understand
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.45,1:08:23.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他们要建一座教堂\N{\rEng}why they built a church
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.89,1:08:26.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在一个非常方便进入的地方\N{\rEng}on top of a very convenient access
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.33,1:08:29.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就在一个塌陷的煤矿上面？\N{\rEng}to a collapsed coal mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.42,1:08:32.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,像对小孩子解释那样\N{\rEng}Explain it to me like I'm a little
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.55,1:08:35.21,c,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢地解释给我听\N{\rEng}a little slow
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.21,1:08:36.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,什-\N{\rEng}Wha-
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.29,1:08:38.25,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他们认为\N{\rEng}S'ppose they thought
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.25,1:08:40.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那是某种通道\N{\rEng}it was some kind of doorway
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.91,1:08:44.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,连接这个世界和另一个世界\N{\rEng}'tween this world and the other
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.69,1:08:48.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想在上面建座教堂\N{\rEng}They reckon they'd drop a church on top
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.09,1:08:51.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,使土地神圣化\N{\rEng}Consecrate the soil
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.31,1:08:52.31,c,,0000,0000,0000,,堵住那个通道\N{\rEng}Block the doorway
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.70,1:08:55.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许不是个好主意\N{\rEng}Maybe not such a swell idea
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.88,1:08:58.93,c,,0000,0000,0000,,直到今天为止一直都还不错\N{\rEng}Worked all right up until today
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.71,1:09:03.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,下面很黑\N{\rEng}It's dark down there
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.80,1:09:07.37,c,,0000,0000,0000,,黑得像魔鬼的屁股眼\N{\rEng}Dark as the devil's asshole
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.94,1:09:10.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们要去\N{\rEng}If we're going
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.85,1:09:14.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带上这个\N{\rEng}I'm bringing this along
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.59,1:09:18.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,也许它还保留着一些神圣的力量\N{\rEng}Maybe it got a bit of holy left in it
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.77,1:09:19.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们？\N{\rEng}We?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.69,1:09:22.86,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不，牧师，我 - 在下面，\N{\rEng}- No, Reverend, I - Down there,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.21,1:09:26.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你一样看不见，姑娘\N{\rEng}I ain't much more blind than you is, girl
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.87,1:11:00.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为有钱人会举办一些很棒的派对\N{\rEng}I always figured rich folks had them some real fine soirees
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.79,1:11:03.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼\N{\rEng}Mm-hmm
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.70,1:11:05.44,c,,0000,0000,0000,,非常棒\N{\rEng}Real fine
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.88,1:11:09.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\rEng}All right
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.95,1:11:37.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆！\N{\rEng}Tom!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:07.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌你希望你的朋友在这里\N{\rEng}Bet you wishing your friend was here
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.68,1:12:10.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，他什么都不怕\N{\rEng}Yeah, he's not afraid of anything
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.64,1:12:12.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，我知道他害怕一件事：\N{\rEng}Oh, I know somethin' afraid of:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.29,1:12:16.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他害怕告诉你他对你的真实感受\N{\rEng}he afraid to tell you how he really feels about you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.09,1:12:26.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆？\N{\rEng}Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.79,1:12:30.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤姆\N{\rEng}Tom
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.49,1:12:34.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.89,1:12:43.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么东西来了\N{\rEng}Something's coming
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.38,1:12:54.77,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.82,1:13:01.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑，姑娘！\N{\rEng}Run, girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.39,1:13:06.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,快点！这边，这边！\N{\rEng}Hurry up! This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.65,1:13:10.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他将吞食你儿子的肉，\N{\rEng}And he shall eat the flesh of your sons,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.70,1:13:12.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,和你女儿的肉\N{\rEng}and the flesh of your daughters
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.92,1:13:15.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他都要吃掉\N{\rEng}shall he eat
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.14,1:13:17.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在愤怒中毁灭他们\N{\rEng}Destroy them in wrath
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.97,1:13:19.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭他们\N{\rEng}Destroy them
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.49,1:13:23.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们不复存在\N{\rEng}that they may be no more
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.59,1:13:31.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法不像子弹，姑娘\N{\rEng}Magic ain't like a bullet, girl
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.42,1:13:33.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能只是扣动扳机\N{\rEng}You just can't pull the trigger
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.81,1:13:37.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,有些事情光靠思考是无法理解的\N{\rEng}Some things you can't understand by thinking
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.38,1:13:40.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,它来自灵魂，而不是肉体！\N{\rEng}It comes from the spirits, not the meat!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.25,1:13:43.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.32,1:14:10.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.15,1:14:12.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，糟糕\N{\rEng}Oh, crap
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.72,1:14:14.59,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.14,1:14:50.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米，你上次感受女人的抚摸是什么时候？\N{\rEng}When's the last time you felt the touch of a woman, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.97,1:14:55.15,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这些年来你一直如此孤独吗？\N{\rEng}Have all these years been so lonesome?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.15,1:14:58.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否坐在那里梦想着我？\N{\rEng}Did you sit up and dream about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.94,1:15:07.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道，我打赌你一直在想着我抚摸你的方式\N{\rEng}I know it, I bet you never stopped thinking about the way I touched you
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.99,1:15:11.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米，你为我硬了吗？\N{\rEng}You got something hard for me, Tommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.69,1:15:13.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是的，我硬了\N{\rEng}Yeah, I do
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.04,1:15:20.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.99,1:15:58.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我深知你是我的儿子\N{\rEng}I know well thou are my son
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.43,1:16:02.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛，\N{\rEng}Thine eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.87,1:16:07.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛证明了这一点\N{\rEng}thine eyes attest to it
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.83,1:16:10.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,别假装这是什么美好的时刻\N{\rEng}Let's not pretend this is some beautiful moment
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.58,1:16:13.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎你\N{\rEng}I don't care about you
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.27,1:16:15.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来就不在乎我\N{\rEng}You never gave a damn about me
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:17.89,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你看着我说这些话？\N{\rEng}Thou should look upon me and say these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.89,1:16:19.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该让你烧死！\N{\rEng}I should let you burn!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.50,1:16:26.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我得把你救出去\N{\rEng}I gotta get you out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.81,1:16:28.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，我亲爱的孩子\N{\rEng}No, my sweet child
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.85,1:16:29.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法被拯救\N{\rEng}I can't be saved
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.60,1:16:33.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这烈火就是我的命运\N{\rEng}This burning be my fate
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.38,1:16:39.26,c,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我犯下的诸多罪行，\N{\rEng}For them many sins I done,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.34,1:16:43.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有的女巫最终都是一样的下场\N{\rEng}all us witches end up the same
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.81,1:17:19.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一种方法能结束这痛苦\N{\rEng}There's only one way to end this pain
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.25,1:17:23.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭我吧，我的儿子\N{\rEng}Destroy me, my son
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.43,1:17:24.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\rEng}No
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.56,1:17:26.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，我做不到\N{\rEng}No, I can't do that
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.17,1:17:27.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能要求我这么做\N{\rEng}You can't ask me to do that
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.65,1:17:28.87,c,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你的蔑视\N{\rEng}For thy scorn
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.87,1:17:30.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你的愤怒\N{\rEng}For thy wrath
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.92,1:17:33.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你恨我是对的\N{\rEng}Thou were right to hate me
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.27,1:17:35.05,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨我自己！\N{\rEng}I hated myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.88,1:17:37.62,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己！\N{\rEng}Myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.62,1:17:40.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这个该死的你创造的怪物！\N{\rEng}This goddam monster you made!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.21,1:18:08.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰我敌人的思想\N{\rEng}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die,Gedanken meiner Feinde
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.95,1:18:12.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\rEng}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.26,1:18:16.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,日出前将他们困在梦中，奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰思想\N{\rEng}Sonnenaufgang in Traäaumen ein,Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die Gedanken
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.92,1:18:20.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\rEng}chlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.79,1:18:24.10,c,,0000,0000,0000,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰思想\N{\rEng}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die Gedanken
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.80,1:18:28.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的眼睛\N{\rEng}Sie ihre Augen
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.15,1:18:31.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,让我如同一个梦\N{\rEng}Let me be as a dream
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.93,1:18:33.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,被遗忘，\N{\rEng}Forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.11,1:18:36.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无意义的尘埃\N{\rEng}Dust without meaning
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.16,1:18:44.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰我敌人的思想\N{\rEng}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die,Gedanken meiner Feinde
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.64,1:18:48.12,c,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\rEng}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.43,1:18:52.04,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一定还有别的办法 - 没有了\N{\rEng}- There's gotta be another way - There is none
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.04,1:18:55.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,奥涅伊洛斯和诺特，触碰我敌人的思想\N{\rEng}Oneiros und Nótt, beruührt die,Gedanken meiner Feinde
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.70,1:18:58.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,闭上他们的眼睛，直到下一次\N{\rEng}SchlieBßen Sie ihre Augen und fangen sie bis zum naächsten
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.83,1:19:00.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,日出前将他们困在梦中\N{\rEng}Sonnenaufgang in Traäaumen ein
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.40,1:19:05.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这痛苦，我再也无法忍受了\N{\rEng}This agony, I can't bare it any longer
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.23,1:19:07.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你了！ - 不！\N{\rEng}- Please! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.23,1:19:09.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！！\N{\rEng}Ahh!!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.15,1:19:18.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！！\N{\rEng}Ahh!!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.26,1:19:38.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧，大个子？\N{\rEng}You alright, big fella?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.96,1:19:41.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,某种陷阱\N{\rEng}Some kind of booby trap
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.61,1:19:44.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一个咒语\N{\rEng}A spell
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.79,1:19:46.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点\N{\rEng}I almost
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.27,1:19:48.84,c,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么打破了它\N{\rEng}something broke it
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.25,1:20:53.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这里闻起来像死亡，\N{\rEng}It smells like death,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.12,1:20:55.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有鸟粪\N{\rEng}and bird shit
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.60,1:20:58.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在这等着\N{\rEng}Wait here
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.43,1:21:47.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\rEng}Oh crap
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.60,1:22:20.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，不，不，不\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.90,1:22:23.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，不\N{\rEng}No, no
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.90,1:22:27.60,c,,0000,0000,0000,,求你，求你，该死！\N{\rEng}Please, please, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.53,1:23:21.83,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.75,1:23:24.96,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！啊！\N{\rEng}Gah! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.19,1:23:29.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃\N{\rEng}Ugh
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.67,1:23:40.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃！呃！\N{\rEng}Egh! Guh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.50,1:23:42.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦！啊！\N{\rEng}Oh! Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.21,1:23:54.30,c,,0000,0000,0000,,呃！\N{\rEng}Uah!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.65,1:24:05.74,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你当初要是把那男孩的头给我就好了\N{\rEng}Better you'd given me that boy's head when you had the offer
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.74,1:24:10.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你第二次可以救你那两面三刀的母亲\N{\rEng}That's twice you might have saved your fork-tongued mother
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.54,1:24:18.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，但你很快就会在她身边了，\N{\rEng}Well, but you'll be by her side soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.58,1:24:23.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱里吮吸那黑色的乳房\N{\rEng}suckling that black teat in hell
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.11,1:24:28.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须死在这房子里来滋养下面的土地，\N{\rEng}You must die in this house to feed the earth beneath,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.46,1:24:30.81,c,,0000,0000,0000,,滋养这些山丘，\N{\rEng}to feed these hills,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.81,1:24:35.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这些活着的古老石头\N{\rEng}these ancient stones that do live
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.73,1:24:37.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，魔鬼，\N{\rEng}Hey there, devil,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.52,1:24:41.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我有东西给你\N{\rEng}I got something for you
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.35,1:24:46.18,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为科拉·费舍尔\N{\rEng}That's for Cora Fisher
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.05,1:24:48.35,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我噎死吧，\N{\rEng}You go on and choke on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.35,1:24:49.70,c,,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\rEng}son of a bitch
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.71,1:25:41.27,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个恶魔，\N{\rEng}Look at this devil,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.41,1:25:47.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,愚弄自己以为自己是个人\N{\rEng}fools himself into thinking he's a man
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.11,1:25:56.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你的路和我的一样终将归于黑暗\N{\rEng}Your road ends in the dark like mine
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.99,1:25:59.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个，\N{\rEng}And this,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.77,1:26:00.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,女巫，\N{\rEng}witch,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.95,1:26:02.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不，我不是\N{\rEng}No I ain't
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.08,1:26:05.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个都会被烧死\N{\rEng}You'll burn, both of ya
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.08,1:26:08.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像科拉·费舍尔被烧死一样\N{\rEng}Like Cora Fisher burns
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.91,1:26:11.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你那女巫母亲被烧死一样\N{\rEng}Like your witch mother burns
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.87,1:26:13.52,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们的下场\N{\rEng}That's all for you
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.41,1:26:25.97,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这是万灵节，不是吗？\N{\rEng}It's all souls, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.03,1:26:38.68,c,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\rEng}Look at it
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.77,1:26:41.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那是我的吗？\N{\rEng}You think that one's mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.16,1:26:42.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.21,1:26:46.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,想必你总有一天会知道的\N{\rEng}Guess you'll find out someday
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.99,1:26:51.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我们所有人一样\N{\rEng}Like all of us
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.70,1:27:04.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我怎么想的吗，汤姆？\N{\rEng}You know what I think, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.97,1:27:09.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你所谓的幸运骨头，\N{\rEng}I think that so-called lucky bone of yours,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.93,1:27:12.58,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得它只是一块猫骨头\N{\rEng}I think it's just a cat bone
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.76,1:27:17.33,c,,0000,0000,0000,,一直以来你以为它蕴含力量，但是\N{\rEng}All this time you thought it held the power, but
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.85,1:27:21.16,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为力量其实在你体内\N{\rEng}I think the power was in you
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.94,1:27:25.73,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他害怕你\N{\rEng}He was afraid of you
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.73,1:27:29.08,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他有理由害怕\N{\rEng}He was right to be
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.08,1:27:43.08,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:鲁文兄弟乐队的《罪人，你最好准备好》]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Sinner You'd Better Get Ready' by The Louvin Brothers]
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.79,1:27:46.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 哦罪人你最好做好准备 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Oh sinner you better get ready ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.57,1:27:50.19,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 罪人必死的时刻即将来临 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ The time's a comin' when the sinner must die ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.19,1:27:53.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 哦上帝给诺亚\N{\rEng}♪ Oh God gave Noah
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.02,1:27:56.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哈，我经历过更糟的情况\N{\rEng}Ha, I've woke up to worse
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.45,1:27:58.63,c,,0000,0000,0000,,突然间我变老了\N{\rEng}All of a sudden I'm old
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.63,1:27:59.85,c,,0000,0000,0000,,汤米\N{\rEng}Tommy
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.07,1:28:04.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该如何面对衰老\N{\rEng}I don't know how to be old
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.77,1:28:11.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我留着这副旧马笼头是有原因的\N{\rEng}I knew I held on to this old bridle for a reason
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.56,1:28:16.39,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 唱着哈利路亚，罪人你最好做好准备 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Singing Halleluya, sinner you bet get ready ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.21,1:28:20.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 罪人必死的时刻即将来临 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ The time's a comin' when the sinner must die ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.22,1:28:29.14,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有女巫最后都落得同样的下场\N{\rEng}All us witches end up the same
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.44,1:28:32.01,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔\N{\rEng}Joe
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.01,1:28:34.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,乔！\N{\rEng}Joe!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.54,1:28:36.23,c,,0000,0000,0000,,啊！\N{\rEng}Arrgh!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.28,1:28:40.11,c,,0000,0000,0000,,芭比·乔，\N{\rEng}Bobbie Jo,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.11,1:28:44.02,c,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嘿，醒醒乔，醒醒！ -\N{\rEng}- Hey, wake up Joe, wake up! -
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.02,1:28:45.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧来吧\N{\rEng}Come on Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.50,1:28:47.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\rEng}Get up
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.99,1:28:53.55,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你进入了隧道\N{\rEng}You went inside the tunnels
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.82,1:28:55.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,简直难以置信\N{\rEng}Unbelievable
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.64,1:28:58.34,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该是聪明的那个\N{\rEng}You're supposed to be the smart one
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.34,1:28:59.95,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，你说得对\N{\rEng}Yeah, you're telling me
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.43,1:29:03.69,c,,0000,0000,0000,,哦，看\N{\rEng}Oh, look
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.78,1:29:07.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我把货物拿回来了\N{\rEng}I got the cargo back
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.05,1:29:09.92,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不错的实地工作，对吧？\N{\rEng}Nice field work, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.36,1:29:15.79,c,,0000,0000,0000,,再说，我在下面不是一个人\N{\rEng}Besides, I wasn't down there by myself
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.53,1:29:18.54,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直和牧师在一起\N{\rEng}I was with the Reverend the whole time
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.75,1:29:22.28,c,,0000,0000,0000,,没有他我绝对出不来\N{\rEng}Never would have gotten out of there without him
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.55,1:29:33.64,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我等不及60年代的到来了\N{\rEng}I can't wait for the 60s
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.64,1:29:35.38,c,,0000,0000,0000,,60年代，是吗？\N{\rEng}60s, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.38,1:29:38.03,c,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是属于我的年代，芭比·乔\N{\rEng}This ain't my decade, Bobbie Jo
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.03,1:29:40.91,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉好时光即将到来\N{\rEng}I feel good times are coming
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.91,1:29:44.00,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么认为\N{\rEng}I think so, too
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.69,1:29:47.61,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会太想念这个地方\N{\rEng}I ain't gonna miss this place much
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.96,1:29:49.57,c,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会\N{\rEng}Me neither
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.00,1:29:52.53,c,,0000,0000,0000,,等不及要回家把这一切都记录下来\N{\rEng}Can't wait to get home and just document all this
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.57,1:29:56.36,c,,0000,0000,0000,,那个汤姆·法雷尔其实不坏\N{\rEng}That Tom Ferrell's not a bad egg
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.83,1:29:59.40,c,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好你及时出现了\N{\rEng}Lucky you came along when you did
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.88,1:30:02.67,c,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是需要一点推动，仅此而已\N{\rEng}He just needed a little push, that's all
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.58,1:30:04.49,c,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿！\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.63,1:30:09.46,c,,0000,0000,0000,,大个子，你什么都不怕，是吗？\N{\rEng}Not afraid of anything, are you, big guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.85,1:30:13.72,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，长成这样也有好处，乔\N{\rEng}Yeah, well, there's an upside to looking like this, Joe
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.03,1:30:18.90,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你看镜子里这张脸看得够久了，那些怪物就不那么可怕了\N{\rEng}You see this face in the mirror long enough the monsters don't look too bad
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.90,1:30:21.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah, yeah
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.90,1:30:23.99,c,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我知道有件事你是害怕的\N{\rEng}I know something you're afraid of, though
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.30,1:30:28.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿啊\N{\rEng}There you are
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.71,1:30:54.97,c,,0,0,0,,[歌曲:牛仔罗伊·布朗的《烦恼》]\N{\rEng}[song: 'Trouble in Mind' by Cowboy Roy Brown]
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.76,1:30:59.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 忧心忡忡，\N{\rEng}♪ Trouble in mind,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.25,1:31:02.94,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我很忧郁，是的 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ I'm blue, yeah ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.47,1:31:07.51,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我不会一直忧郁，鲍勃会的 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ I won't be blue always, Bob will ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.91,1:31:09.65,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 因为阳光终会照进 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Cause that sun is gonna shine ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.04,1:31:12.17,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我的后门 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ in my back door someday ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.17,1:31:13.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 希望很快，啊男孩\N{\rEng}♪ Hope soon and aha boy
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.43,1:31:18.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 忧心忡忡很忧郁 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Trouble in mind is blue ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.13,1:31:22.66,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我只看到我六月的障碍 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ I just see me blockade June ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.06,1:31:33.06,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 当你看到我笑\N{\rEng}♪ When you see me laughin'
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.06,1:31:35.50,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我笑只是为了不哭 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ I'm laughin' just to keep from cryin' ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.93,1:31:37.76,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 必须让我 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Gotta let me ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.68,1:31:45.29,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 忧心忡忡，我很忧郁\N{\rEng}♪ Trouble in mind, I'm blue
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.77,1:31:49.56,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我不会一直忧郁，为什么？ ♪\N{\rEng}♪ And I won't be blue all way, why? ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.56,1:31:53.47,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 因为阳光终会照进我的后门 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ Because sun's gonna shine in my back door some day ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.47,1:31:56.43,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 要去河边\N{\rEng}♪ Going down to the river
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.52,1:31:57.82,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 我要带上我的摇椅 ♪\N{\rEng}♪ And I'm going to take my rockin' chair ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.82,1:31:59.48,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪ 你要做什么？\N{\rEng}♪ What you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.48,1:32:03.13,c,,0000,0000,0000,,♪如果忧郁把我带走，我要离开这里\N{\rEng}♪ And if the blues take me I'm gonna rock away from here

